MrFrost Legacy Archive License
==============================

Copyright (c) 2020-2021 MrFrost <https://github.com/MrFrostDev>

This project is archived and unmaintained. It is published by its author as a
historical re-upload of commissioned user-interface work that was never
shipped, originally posted on Native-Network as a hard-drive cleanout.

These terms restate, in plain form, the conditions already written into the
header of every dialog authored by MrFrost in this repository. Where this
document and a file header appear to differ, they are meant to say the same
thing; read them together.

This repository is a source dump, not an installable package. It contains
dialog layouts, not the controller functions that drive them.


1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   You may download, read, study and modify this software.

   You may use it, in whole or in part, in your own Arma 3 missions, including
   on game servers that you operate and including servers that accept
   donations, free of charge and without asking permission.

   You may share your modifications privately, and you may publish patches,
   diffs or instructions that describe changes to it.


2. ATTRIBUTION

   The author headers in the source files must remain intact. Do not remove
   them, do not rewrite them, and do not replace the author's name with your
   own.

   You may add your own name to the "Edited by :" line where one is present.
   That line exists for exactly this purpose.


3. REDISTRIBUTION

   You may not publish or distribute this software, whether original or
   modified, under a different name or as your own work.

   You may not re-upload it to other script sites, marketplaces, forums or
   file hosts without the author's explicit prior permission.

   Linking to this repository is always permitted and never requires
   permission.


4. NO COMMERCIAL USE

   You may not sell this software or any modified version of it.

